  "notes": "## 0.19.0-alpha.1 - 2026-07-08\n\n### Features\n\n- Mobile companion sync can now receive desktop clipboard changes immediately instead of waiting for periodic refreshes (#1295)\n- Add a right-click menu in the Quick Panel for copying, favoriting, sending, revealing files, and deleting entries (#1305)\n- Add Cmd/Ctrl+C and Cmd/Ctrl+V shortcuts in the Quick Panel for copying or pasting the hovered or selected entry (#1306)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Prevent mobile companion sync from missing back-to-back image or file copies and from re-applying an item it just sent (#1301)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.19.0-alpha.1 - 2026-07-08\n\n### Features\n\n- 移动端伴侣同步现在可以立即收到桌面剪贴板变化，不必等待周期刷新 (#1295)\n- 快捷面板新增右键菜单，可直接复制、收藏、发送、打开文件位置和删除条目 (#1305)\n- 快捷面板新增 Cmd/Ctrl+C 与 Cmd/Ctrl+V 快捷键，可复制或粘贴当前悬停或选中的条目 (#1306)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复移动端伴侣同步可能漏掉连续复制的图片或文件、或重复应用刚发送条目的问题 (#1301)",
